 "intro": [
  "$P(X=d)=\\frac{{}_{n-d}\\mathrm C_2}{{}_n\\mathrm C_3}$.",
  "하키스틱 항등식 → $E(X)=\\frac{n+1}4$, $V=\\frac{3(n+1)(n-3)}{80}$ → $n=13$."
